      "writtenOn": "2016-12-07T04:28:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "AIDL c++ maps java int to c++ int32_t:\nhttps://android.googlesource.com/platform/system/tools/aidl/+/refs/heads/master/docs/aidl-cpp.md\nInternally wificond uses uint32_t for frequency. \nCompiler refuses to convert vector\u003cuint32_t\u003e to vector\u003cint32_t\u003e explicitly.\nI am fine either keeping this conversion or changing band_info_.band_2g to vector\u003cint32_t\u003e",
