        "id": 1081399
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-12-07T01:19:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Consider removing this local variable, and inlining the RHS in the next expression. i.e.\n\n  EXPECT_NE(nullptr, Init...().get());\n\n(I just don\u0027t think the local variable accomplishes anything.)",
