      "writtenOn": "2016-12-07T01:19:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This would make more sense as EXPECT_NE. ASSERT_NE is useful when some precondition for the test can\u0027t be met. But this isn\u0027t a precondition. This is a postcondition.\n\nSee https://github.com/google/googletest/blob/master/googletest/docs/Primer.md for more discussion of what ASSERT* and EXPECT* do",
      "range": {
